## Fit Explorer camera to node plus neighbors

Context: Zooming on a selected KG Explorer node used Sigma ratio 0.08, so the
node filled the canvas and neighbors fell off-screen. Click and selectEntity
now frame the ego network with a higher min ratio and more padding.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Camera fit includes neighbors; min ratio 0.22; padding 2.4; click also frames.
2. tests/units/front/test_explorer_camera_fit.py
   Contract for neighbor expansion and no tight 0.08 single-node zoom.
3. docs/user-guide.md
   Click zooms so the entity and its neighbors fit on the canvas.

